trong\">Vanessa</span>: Since I've started cooking for a living, I've been spending more and more time in specialty food emporiums."}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img01.jpg", "time": "13500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: How long have you been into cooking? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I've been taken with recipe books since I was a kid. I've been into cooking in a big way since I started college. Aunt Nelly has been encouraging me to follow this career path for years!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I've always loved shopping. Shopping for food has been an eye-opener. It isn't as easy as it looks."}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img05.jpg", "time": "32500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I haven't had time to have people over in the past month. I've been itching to try some of these rice dishes for a bit now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's been quite a while since we've done anything like this. Have you decided whether to invite Marleene?"}, {"image": "engenn7le18ob03re2img02.jpg", "time": "45000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Maybe. I think a new perspective would help a bit. I haven't had an honest critique from an outsider in a while!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have been going out more lately. I've gone to the pub and bowling with my colleagues a few times. I haven't been having dinner out with them though. They eat in terrible places!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le18ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le18ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use words like <span class=\"italic\">since</span>, <span class=\"italic\">for</span> and <span class=\"italic\">in</span> to describe duration.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about 